[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3620591008","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113683#issuecomment-3620591008","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113683","id":3620591008,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7XzdWg","user":{"login":"scgm0","id":52148221,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMTQ4MjIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52148221?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0","html_url":"https://github.com/scgm0","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-06T15:34:27Z","updated_at":"2025-12-06T15:34:27Z","body":"The document means that after `ProjectSettings.load_resource_pack`, modifications to the local `res://` directory will not be reflected in `DirAccess.get_directories_at`, not that `DirAccess.get_directories_at` cannot display files added from `.pck`.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3620591008/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3621890116","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113683#issuecomment-3621890116","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113683","id":3621890116,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7X4ahE","user":{"login":"HexagonNico","id":51746628,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzQ2NjI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51746628?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HexagonNico","html_url":"https://github.com/HexagonNico","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HexagonNico/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HexagonNico/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HexagonNico/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HexagonNico/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HexagonNico/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HexagonNico/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HexagonNico/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HexagonNico/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HexagonNico/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-07T10:19:15Z","updated_at":"2025-12-07T10:19:15Z","body":"I don't quite understand the difference between \"displaying the added files\" and \"showing modifications\", but if it's intended I'll close the issue.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3621890116/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3624314122","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113683#issuecomment-3624314122","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113683","id":3624314122,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7YBqUK","user":{"login":"scgm0","id":52148221,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMTQ4MjIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52148221?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0","html_url":"https://github.com/scgm0","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-08T02:45:23Z","updated_at":"2025-12-08T02:45:23Z","body":"> I don't quite understand the difference between \"displaying the added files\" and \"showing modifications\", but if it's intended I'll close the issue.\n\nYou missed the key point. The issue is whether the modification to `res://` comes from the local system or from loading a `.pck` file. In the Godot editor (including exports for certain platforms), `res://` is by default mapped to a local directory. After using `ProjectSettings.load_resource_pack`, `res://` will be remapped to the directory within the pck system, and you can no longer use `DirAccess.get_directories_at` to retrieve changes in the local directory corresponding to `res://`.\n\nBefore a certain version, loading a pck would cause `DirAccess` to completely lose information about the local `res://`. However, now, when loading for the first time, the contents of the local `res://` are also mapped into the pck system. Therefore, you can still use `DirAccess.get_directories_at` to retrieve information about the old local `res://`, but any subsequent changes to the local `res://` cannot be obtained.\n\n`FileAccess` is not affected by this.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3624314122/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]